Depends: R (>= 3.0.1)
Imports: stats
Description: Uses similarity graphs to estimate change-points and their p-values. The main functions accept either observations or dissimilarities, construct a k-MST with k=floor(sqrt(N)) by default, and report the max-type scan. A supplied similarity graph and the generalized, original, and weighted scans remain available explicitly.
